        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Miles Doleac, Johnny Depp, Christina Ricci, Miranda Richardson, Michael Gambon, Casper Van Dien, Jeffrey Jones, Washington Irving\n- Products: Sleepy Hollow (film), The Hollow (2016 film), Treme, Sleepy Hollow, American Horror Story, Salem, Complications, Roots, Containment\n- Topics: Acting roles, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Washington Irving wrote the 1820 short story \"The Legend of Sleepy Hollow.\"\n- Sleepy Hollow is a film adaptation loosely inspired by Washington Irving's 1820 short story \"The Legend of Sleepy Hollow.\"\n- Sleepy Hollow stars Johnny Depp and Christina Ricci, with Miranda Richardson, Michael Gambon, Casper Van Dien, and Jeffrey Jones in supporting roles.\n- Since 2011, Miles Doleac has had acting roles in Treme, Sleepy Hollow, American Horror Story, Salem, Complications, Roots, and several episodes of the CW's Containment.\n- The Hollow is a 2016 American crime film directed and written by Miles Doleac.",
